## Adding a feature

1. `mkdir -p fastmcp/app/features/widgets/{tools,resources,utils}`
2. `_server.py`: `server = FastMCP(name="widgets")`
3. `utils/service.py`: pure logic.
4. `tools/<name>.py`: one `@server.tool` named `<name>`, delegating to the service.
5. `__init__.py`: `from ._server import server` + `import_submodules(__name__, __path__)`.
6. `app/schemas/<entity>.py`: pydantic models (classes prefixed `<Entity>`).
7. `app/tests/features/widgets/tools/test_<name>.py` (+ `utils/test_service.py`).

Then `dude lint && dude test`.
